<title>CHINA: China Jan-May aluminium exports up 83.O pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-May aluminium exports up 83.O pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought aluminium and aluminium materials were 102,140 tonnes in the first five months of 1997, up 83.0 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>		  EXPORTS JAN-MAY    MAY     YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p>Unwrought</p>
<p>aluminium and</p>
<p>aluminium</p>
<p> materials     102,140	   23,660	+83.0</p>
<p>Unwrought</p>
<p>aluminium</p>
<p>including</p>
<p> alloys	   67,884	   11,394	+77.8</p>
<p>Aluminium</p>
<p> materials	34,255	   12,266	+94.5</p>
<p> Alumina		 0		  0</p>
<p>IMPORTS	    JAN-MAY	  MAY     YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p>Unwrought</p>
<p>aluminium and</p>
<p>aluminium</p>
<p> materials     253,230	   64,991	+ 3.1</p>
<p>Unwrought</p>
<p>aluminium</p>
<p>including</p>
<p> alloys	  140,651	   38,215	- 8.9</p>
<p>Aluminium</p>
<p> materials     112,578	   26,776	+23.7</p>
<p> Alumina	 410,000	   30,000	- 4.1</p>
<p>Note: Figures in tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
